OL,3,ASome childhood offenders may no longer
OL,4,Ahave to reveal convictions to employers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome job applicants in England and
OL,7,FWales would no longer need to declare
OL,8,Fcriminal convictions they received as
OL,9,Fchildren under government proposals
OL,10,Fdesigned to improve the employment
OL,11,Fprospects of rehabilitated young
OL,12,Fpeople.
OL,14,FThe changes would mean criminal records
OL,15,Ffor people detained when they were
OL,16,Funder 18 years old would no longer show
OL,17,Fup for life during checks carried out
OL,18,Fby employers.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
