OL,3,ASome childhood offenders may no longer
OL,4,Ahave to reveal convictions to employers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Justice has also
OL,7,Flaunched a consultation on relaxing
OL,8,Fdisclosure requirements for some
OL,9,Fspecific drug-related and violent
OL,10,Fcrimes committed by children.
OL,12,FYoung people who have not re-offended
OL,13,Fas adults struggle to find work because
OL,14,Fof their past behaviour, the government
OL,15,Fsays.
